cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below, and also
  cite the underlying white-dwarf model papers listed in the README (Credits).
title: "WHIST — White-dwarf HR-diagram Interactive Simulation Tool"
abstract: >-
  An interactive, in-browser (Pyodide) white-dwarf population simulator that
  renders a simulated Gaia colour-magnitude (HR) diagram from adjustable model
  parameters, overlaid on the observed 120 pc Gaia white-dwarf sample.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Ziv
    given-names: Yoav
license: MIT
url: "https://github.com/yovon/whist-web"
repository-code: "https://github.com/yovon/whist-web"
keywords:
  - white dwarfs
  - astronomy
  - astrophysics
  - Gaia
  - population synthesis
  - Pyodide
